#: app/templates/auth/register.html:7
msgid ""
"Every account needs an identity check before you can use the club. The "
"check is done by Stripe, we do not store your documents."
msgstr ""
"Jedes Konto braucht eine Identitätsprüfung, bevor du den Club nutzen "
"kannst. Die Prüfung macht Stripe, Dokumente speichern wir nicht."

#: app/templates/auth/register.html:13
msgid "First name"
msgstr "Vorname"

#: app/templates/auth/register.html:19
msgid "Last name"
msgstr "Nachname"

#: app/templates/auth/register.html:32
msgid "At least 10 characters."
msgstr "Mindestens 10 Zeichen."

#: app/templates/auth/register.html:37
msgid "Country of residence"
msgstr "Wohnsitzland"

#: app/templates/auth/register.html:39
msgid "Please choose"
msgstr "Bitte wählen"

#: app/templates/auth/register.html:48
msgid "Confirmations"
msgstr "Bestätigungen"

#: app/templates/auth/register.html:52
msgid ""
"I have read the privacy notice and agree that my data is processed to run "
"my account."
msgstr ""
"Ich habe die Datenschutzhinweise gelesen und stimme zu, dass meine Daten "
"für mein Konto verarbeitet werden."

#: app/templates/auth/register.html:58
msgid "I accept the terms of use."
msgstr "Ich akzeptiere die Nutzungsbedingungen."

#: app/templates/auth/register.html:64
msgid ""
"I agree that Stripe checks my identity document and a selfie. Stripe "
"processes this data, the club only receives the result."
msgstr ""
"Ich stimme zu, dass Stripe mein Ausweisdokument und ein Selfie prüft. "
"Stripe verarbeitet diese Daten, der Club erhält nur das Ergebnis."

#: app/templates/auth/register.html:69
